<title>SWITZERLAND: Tietmeyer says Italian inflation outlook improved.</title>
<headline>Tietmeyer says Italian inflation outlook improved.</headline>
<dateline>BASLE, Switzerland 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bundesbank President Hans Tietmeyer said the outlook for inflation in Italy had improved.</p>
<p>&quot;We heard a report about Italy and there is a better outlook as far as inflation,&quot; Tietmeyer said after a meeting of Group of 10 (G10) central bank governors at the Bank for International Settlements.</p>
<p>The G10 governors were briefed on the Italian situation by Antonio Fazio, governor of the Bank of Italy.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
